    {
      "number": 1688,
      "title": "The Terminal's builds are attached to the release of the packages",
      "state": "closed",
      "draft": false,
      "updated_at": "2026-10-02T18:35:38Z",
      "merged_at": "2026-10-02T18:35:38Z",
      "user": "Rafael-SOWNet",
      "base": "master",
      "head": "the-terminal-is-attached-to-the-release",
      "url": "https://github.com/asc-community/AngouriMath/pull/1688",
      "recent_reviews": [],
      "recent_issue_comments": [
        {
          "user": "Happypig375",
          "created_at": "2026-10-02T17:01:18Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-02T17:01:18Z",
          "body": "The Lab's content, which seem to be C++ and notebooks, are verified migrated to main repo already, right?"
        },
        {
          "user": "Rafael-SOWNet",
          "created_at": "2026-10-02T17:46:08Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-02T17:46:08Z",
          "body": "Not all of it, no. I compared each of Lab's branches with master:\n\n- **C++.** The source is here: `Sources/Wrappers/AngouriMath.CPP.Exporting` and `.Importing`, their tests, `Sources/Samples/CPlusPlusPlayground`, `CPPBuild.yml` and `CPPTest.yml`. The distribution isn't. The website's C++ quickstart fetches Lab's `cpp-release` branch, and its CMakeLists downloads the binaries of Lab's `0.0.0-poc` release, built in May 2021. `CPPBuild.yml` keeps its builds as workflow artifacts only, so nothing here publishes newer ones.\n- **Notebooks.** Not migrated. Lab's `try` branch has an F# tutorial of 68 cells, with plotting, and a C# notebook of 9 cells. Here there are two samples of 5 cells each in `Sources/Samples`.\n- The `try` branch is also the Binder setup behind the README's Try button. It holds AngouriGamma too, a WPF demo of the limit, simplifier and solver that exists nowhere else.\n- Lab's `main` branch has `articles.md` and `we-thank.md`.\n\nThis PR moves only the Terminal's builds. I've put the rest on #1689's checklist, so Lab isn't archived until each has a home here.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_012sonx8iAspMiwRwok"
        },
        {
          "user": "Happypig375",
          "created_at": "2026-10-02T18:20:02Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-02T18:20:02Z",
          "body": "AngouriGamma should be migrated to a web app for v3.1, and redesigned according to https://github.com/asc-community/AngouriMath/issues/1649#issuecomment-5937212347 alongside the existing website. "
        },
        {
          "user": "Rafael-SOWNet",
          "created_at": "2026-10-02T18:35:27Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-02T18:35:27Z",
          "body": "Filed as #1692 in 3.1, beside the website, and ticked on #1689's checklist: its source stays readable in the archived Lab until then.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_012sonx8iAspMiwRwokT1Ura\n"
        }
      ],
